@startuml
actor Caller
participant LifecycleController as Lifecycle
participant ProviderComposition as Composition
participant CommunicationProvider as Provider
Caller -> Lifecycle: declare and validate endpoints and route
Caller -> Composition: prepare(route spec, exact handles)
Composition -> Lifecycle: authenticate snapshots and retained declarations
Composition -> Composition: compare complete declarations and capabilities
Composition -> Provider: prepare internal resource without traffic
Provider --> Composition: internal prepared token
Caller -> Composition: activate prepared provider route
Composition -> Lifecycle: require exact validated route and active endpoints
Composition -> Provider: activate internal resource
Provider --> Composition: internal active snapshot
Composition --> Caller: composition-issued provider-route handle
Caller -> Lifecycle: activate exact lifecycle route
Caller -> Composition: submit(handle, immutable item)
Composition -> Lifecycle: require exact active route and endpoints
Composition -> Composition: validate complete item binding
Composition -> Provider: submit validated internal token and item
Provider --> Caller: bounded outcome
@enduml
